{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02459",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.66,
      "end_seconds": 5.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Afternoon, doctor. They're in and comfortable, and I have the measurements ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.43,
      "end_seconds": 10.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Okay, thanks. Hi, how can I help today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.27,
      "end_seconds": 17.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.72,
      "text": "It's a feeling of something stuck in my throat, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.54,
      "end_seconds": 24.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "let's run through your medicines i'll explain everything as we go along"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.51,
      "end_seconds": 43.31,
      "duration_seconds": 17.8,
      "text": "I take alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones. I told my wife I'd come today. Tiotropium inhaler, once a day. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.66,
      "end_seconds": 46.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "mm, okay. How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.9,
      "end_seconds": 51.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.74,
      "end_seconds": 57.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "right, any a sharp scratch when swallowing as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.96,
      "end_seconds": 72.65,
      "duration_seconds": 13.69,
      "text": "yes, about the same, two days with sharp scratch when swallowing, a seven out of ten, I suppose and I've been having eaten fish as well, for four weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.23,
      "end_seconds": 77.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Have you had any blood, difficulty breathing or drooling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.59,
      "end_seconds": 82.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "nope, nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.08,
      "end_seconds": 86.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "yes okay, did you notice any neck swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.82,
      "end_seconds": 90.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "No. No neck swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.31,
      "end_seconds": 93.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.08,
      "end_seconds": 102.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Yeah, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.04,
      "end_seconds": 111.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.2,
      "end_seconds": 120.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, I move fine otherwise"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.24,
      "end_seconds": 130.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.89,
      "end_seconds": 136.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "yes, thin bones i have COPD, for about ten years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.53,
      "end_seconds": 143.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.02,
      "end_seconds": 157.57,
      "duration_seconds": 12.55,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I have about eight cigarettes in a day. I live with my elderly mother. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.45,
      "end_seconds": 176.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.84,
      "end_seconds": 180.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Ah, no, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.8,
      "end_seconds": 186.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "so, any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.97,
      "end_seconds": 190.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 191.43,
      "end_seconds": 206.54,
      "duration_seconds": 15.11,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Oxygen saturation is 98 percent, height 183 centimetres, BMI works out to 23.6, pressure 108 over 79, temperature is 36.7 degrees, weight 79 kilos, heart rate 76, respiratory rate 15."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.56,
      "end_seconds": 209.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.77,
      "end_seconds": 212.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.69,
      "end_seconds": 215.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "yes, that's fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.02,
      "end_seconds": 219.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.57,
      "end_seconds": 237.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "I can't see anything in the throat and the neck is not tender"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.18,
      "end_seconds": 245.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.44,
      "end_seconds": 266.15,
      "duration_seconds": 11.71,
      "text": "right, here's what I'm thinking. I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be a possible fish bone scratch or lodged bone, or it might be a pharyngeal scratch"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.04,
      "end_seconds": 269.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.62,
      "end_seconds": 293.46,
      "duration_seconds": 22.84,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's a possible fish bone scratch or lodged bone, and we'll know more once the a neck X-ray is back let me repeat that back to make sure you've had a feeling of something stuck in your throat, moderate, and no difficulty breathing or blood"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.78,
      "end_seconds": 296.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "yes, you've got it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.33,
      "end_seconds": 315.43,
      "duration_seconds": 17.1,
      "text": "Let's get a neck X-ray, for foreign body sensation. Sip water and eat soft foods; if it persists we look with a camera. Please come and see me if still stuck tomorrow. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.18,
      "end_seconds": 319.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}